                "text": "Translation: \u201cWe have a plan- we just cut nearly a TRILLION in funding from Medicaid.\u201d\n\nWhile the GOP has a \"lot of ideas,\" people are losing their health care coverage, costs are skyrocketing, hospitals are being forced to close.\n\nAmericans deserve better than this.",
